			</p>
		<!-- Horizontal Rule Not Implimented -->
			<p>
				You may <em>not</em> use textbooks, course notes, or a calculator during this exam. Organize your work in a reasonable, neat, and coherent way. Any answer must be supported by calculations, explanation, and/or algebraic work to receive full credit. Partial credit may be given.<!-- linebreak -->
